        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-D.3-SM9> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The world is dynamic and to remain sustainable, use of wild species requires constant negotiation and adaptive management. It also requires a common vision of sustainable use and transformative change in the human-nature relationship." ;
