<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2344805/items/ZH3L9RVH> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/SUA22ch5>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/SUA22ch6> ;
